# Agricultural Futures Seasonality

When the user asks about seasonal patterns, strong or weak months, crop-cycle
timing, or seasonality-based research for Chinese agricultural futures, read
`.cursor/skills/ag-futures-seasonality/SKILL.md` and follow its workflow.

Read `.cursor/skills/ag-futures-seasonality/references/crop-calendar.md` for
crop-cycle interpretation and `references/source_boundary.md` for evidence
limits. Use `scripts/seasonality.py` for deterministic calculations. Always
show the data window, sample years, significance, and multiple-testing caveat;
do not turn historical seasonality into a buy/sell signal.
